Package: bartDoseReview
Type: Package
Title: Review and Explanation of BART-Guided Dose Recommendations
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Siyi", "Chen", email = "sche11@lsuhsc.edu",
    role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-8019-8149"))
Description: Functions for reviewing dose recommendations from Bayesian additive
    regression tree analyses. The package constructs decisions from numerical
    intervals, selects minimum-cost supporting reports, evaluates changes that
    permit alternative doses, and provides independent reference sampling.
    Study scripts and helpers reproduce the accompanying analyses with a
    separately supplied reproducibility bundle.
License: file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports: digest, gmp, grDevices, grid, jsonlite, stats, utils
Suggests: BART (>= 2.9.9), ggplot2, posterior, readxl
URL: https://github.com/chen-siyi7/BART_dose_review
NeedsCompilation: no
